# NZ Agronomy App — Environment Variables
#
# IMPORTANT: This key must NOT have a VITE_ prefix.
# Without VITE_, Vite will NOT embed it in the browser bundle.
# It is only available to the Netlify serverless functions (server-side).
#
# Get your key from: https://console.anthropic.com
ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=your_anthropic_api_key_here

# ── How to run locally ────────────────────────────────────────
# Option A (recommended): netlify dev
#   npm install -g netlify-cli
#   netlify dev
#   → Runs Vite + serverless functions together at http://localhost:8888
#
# Option B: npm run dev  (AI features will not work without the functions)
#   npm run dev
#   → Frontend only at http://localhost:5173
